+### Incremental Delivery
+
+1. Setup + Foundational → foundation ready.
+2. Add User Story 1 → validate independently → MVP.
+3. Add User Story 2 → validate independently (S4) → documentation truthful.
+4. Add User Story 3 → validate independently (S1/S3/scope audit) → single source of truth proven intact.
+5. Each increment adds value without breaking previous stories (FR-009 keeps delivery semantics stable throughout).
+
+### Parallel Team Strategy
+
+With multiple developers:
+
+1. One person completes Setup + Foundational.
+2. Once T003 passes: Developer A: User Story 1 (the four paired edits must land as one logical group so the pairs never drift mid-flight); Developer B: User Story 2 (README paragraph); Developer C: User Story 3 audits, run last against the finished tree.
+3. Phase 6 closes the run with the consolidated evidence record.
